.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH TAC 1 "2026-09-01"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
tac \- Write each file to standard output, last line first.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBtac\fR [OPTION]... [FILE]...
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Write each file to standard output, last line first.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-b\fR, \fB\-\-before\fR
attach the separator before instead of after
.TP
\fB\-r\fR, \fB\-\-regex\fR
interpret the sequence as a regular expression
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-separator\fR \fI<STRING>\fR
use STRING as the separator instead of newline
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v(uutils coreutils) 0.11.0
